## ⚡ **Load Testing**

### **Artillery Configuration** (`artillery.yml`)

```yaml
config:
  target: "https://your-app.vercel.app"
  phases:
    - duration: 60
      arrivalRate: 5
      name: "Warm up"
    - duration: 120
      arrivalRate: 20
      name: "Sustained load"
    - duration: 60
      arrivalRate: 50
      name: "Spike test"
  processor: "./test-processor.js"

scenarios:
  - name: "Form Submission Flow"
    flow:
      - post:
          url: "/api/form/submit"
          json:
            stage: 1
            data:
              companyName: "Load Test {{ $randomString() }}"
              industry: "technology"
          capture:
            - json: "$.formId"
              as: "formId"
      - get:
          url: "/api/form/{{ formId }}"
      - think: 2
      - post:
          url: "/api/form/{{ formId }}/stage/2"
          json:
            stage: 2
            data:
              firstName: "Test"
              lastName: "User"
```

**Run load tests:**
```bash
# Install Artillery
npm install -g artillery

# Run test
artillery run artillery.yml

# Generate report
artillery run --output report.json artillery.yml
artillery report report.json
```

