## 🔒 **Security Testing**

### **Automated Security Scanning**

```bash
# Check for vulnerable dependencies
npm audit

# Fix vulnerabilities
npm audit fix

# Run OWASP ZAP scan
docker run -t owasp/zap2docker-stable zap-baseline.py \
  -t https://your-app.vercel.app
```

### **Security Test Checklist**

- [ ] **Authentication**: Test unauthorized access
- [ ] **Authorization**: Test privilege escalation
- [ ] **Input Validation**: Test SQL injection, XSS
- [ ] **CSRF Protection**: Verify CSRF tokens
- [ ] **Rate Limiting**: Test API rate limits
- [ ] **Secrets**: Ensure no secrets in logs/responses
- [ ] **HTTPS**: Verify all connections use HTTPS
- [ ] **Headers**: Check security headers (CSP, HSTS, etc.)

### **Manual Security Tests**

**SQL Injection Test:**
```bash
curl -X POST https://your-app.vercel.app/api/form/submit \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"stage": 1, "data": {"companyName": "Test\"; DROP TABLE forms;--"}}'
```

**XSS Test:**
```bash
curl -X POST https://your-app.vercel.app/api/form/submit \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"stage": 1, "data": {"companyName": "<script>alert(1)</script>"}}'
```

